        "tree_id": "9e03c006f9570559c29fcee4b0e2874b073162f0",
        "message": "tui: multiline cursor, mouse takeover, attach approval, session search highlight\n\n- Multiline input: Up/Down move between lines (column preserved, wide\n  chars respected); first/last line falls through to input history.\n- Mouse takeover (pi-style fullscreen): press-drag-release with per-cell\n  reverse selection, wide chars never sliced mid-cell; release copies,\n  right-click pastes, click toggles a collapsed thinking block.\n- Fix highlight_cells: the per-piece width reset dropped the span-local\n  offset base after the first highlighted run, shifting every later\n  cell — selections highlighted the wrong cells from the second run on.\n- attach: the server announces the session's approval mode in the SSE\n  ready frame; the attach TUI shows a YOLO badge for never mode.\n- native: Claude-style dark/light palettes (bg #1a1a1a / #faf9f5,\n  accent #d77757 / #c15f3c).\n- Session picker: case-insensitive search hits render accent+bold.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
        "timestamp": "2026-11-17T17:01:34Z",
